  "name": "食谱：羊杂哈吉斯",
  "desc": "<p><span>步骤详实的食谱，记载着「羊杂哈吉斯」的制作方法。</span></p>",
  "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/10/23/88072335/955d23a38b8e91a5e5c9de7547d7a320_4998463067250263782.png",
